{{cit|p|r||Booster Pack}}

== Effects ==
* Drops 5 random [[card]]s.

== Notes ==
* Of the 5 cards spawned, they will have the following chances to be a type of card.
** 1 out of 5 cards: 93.3% [[Cards_and_Runes#Playing_Cards|playing card]], 6.67% [[special card]]
** 4 out of 5 cards: 76.7% [[Tarot card]], 19.3% [[Cards_and_Runes#Playing_Cards|playing card]], 4% [[special card]]
* {{p|Emergency Contact}}, {{p|Dice Shard}} and {{p|Cracked Key}} cannot be spawned by this item, as they are not considered cards.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Little Baggy}}: Spawns 5 random [[pill]]s instead.

== Trivia ==
* The mechanic of having one guaranteed playing card is a reference to [[wikipedia:Booster pack|booster packs]] in real life. Packs are guaranteed to contain a few cards of high rarity while the rest are randomly chosen. Each card can also be of an even rarer quality, illustrated here by the small chance of obtaining a special card.
* [[anti:Booster Pack|Booster Pack]] is from the ''Antibirth'' mod where it would drop 3 random cards instead of 5.

